# Zitadel OIDC client config — Makefile exports real values (from
# dev/zitadel/secrets/zitadel.env, written by `make dev-infra` /
# scripts/zitadel-bootstrap.mjs) that take priority over these at runtime;
# these only need to be *valid-shaped* placeholders so `next build` can
# parse apps/shell/lib/env.ts without a running Zitadel.
# auth.tesserix.localhost, not localhost: the dev IdP deliberately sits on a
# DIFFERENT registrable domain from the app (helivanta.localhost) so browser
# requests between them are cross-site exactly as they are in production
# (#916, design spec D6 — see the repo README's "Hosts" section).
NEXT_PUBLIC_ZITADEL_ISSUER_URL=http://auth.tesserix.localhost:20080
NEXT_PUBLIC_ZITADEL_CLIENT_ID=set-by-make-dev-infra
# Server-side rewrite targets
MEDICORE_URL=http://localhost:4302
PHARMACY_URL=http://localhost:4303
LAB_URL=http://localhost:4304
API_URL=http://localhost:8080
